&control
    prefix='gan'
    calculation='scf',
    tstress=.true.,
    tprnfor=.true.,
    pseudo_dir = '/home/elie/PP/'
    wf_collect=.true.
    outdir='/home/elie/2D-GaN/THERMO/OUT/'
    etot_conv_thr=1.0D-6
    forc_conv_thr=1.0D-5

 /
 &system
    ibrav=0, nat=2, ntyp= 2, ecutwfc=85,  occupations='fixed', nbnd=16



/
 &electrons
    electron_maxstep=2000
    conv_thr=1.D-7,
    mixing_beta=0.05D0,
    mixing_mode='plain',
   !diagonalization='cg'

 /
&ions
ion_dynamics='bfgs'
/

&cell
cell_dynamics='bfgs'
press=0.0
cell_dofree='2Dxy'
/

ATOMIC_SPECIES
 N   14.00674  N-paw-sr.upf
 Ga  69.72300  Ga-paw-sr.upf

CELL_PARAMETERS angstrom
   3.210406970   0.000000000   0.000000000
  -1.605203485   2.780293939   0.000000000
   0.000000000   0.000000000  20.000000000

ATOMIC_POSITIONS angstrom
Ga           -0.0000015803        1.8535302144       10.2015674076
N             1.6052050651        0.9267637245       10.2024325924

K_POINTS automatic
14 14 1 0 0 0
